        <mxCell id="legend" value="Labelled Data Flows (MVP)&#xa;&#xa;Flow A — Task i Capture:&#xa;  User upload → Next.js → Node DocumentController → store file → n8n WF1 → Azure OCR → OpenAI → extraction_fields + confidence → Supabase&#xa;&#xa;Flow B — Task ii Verification:&#xa;  User trigger validate → Node VerificationController → n8n WF2 → Verification API (+ ABR) → compare fields → discrepancies flagged → verification_results → Supabase&#xa;&#xa;Flow C — Task iii Dashboard (Nice to have):&#xa;  Next.js → Node DashboardController → DashboardService → aggregate confidence % → rank applications → UI" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffff88;strokeColor=#36393d;" vertex="1" parent="1">
